      "index": 0,
      "mapName": "Festival of life 4.h3m",
      "regionText": "You have risen through the ranks quickly, proving your worth and capabilities as a warrior and leader.  Now you challenge King Boragus for the Throne of Krewlod itself.  If you can defeat the powerful Boragus it will prove your battle skills and determination are unrivaled in all of Krewlod.  This one is to the death.  The winner rules.",
      "prologText": "Many respect King Boragus.  Many feel he is one of the greatest rulers Krewlod has ever known.  I do not know this king personally and I find his accomplishments unimpressive.  If he is to earn my respect, he will do so only when he stands over my grave.",
      "epilogText": "I have bathed in the blood of my enemies and sit upon the throne of Krewlod.  My reign begins now.  I am king.",
