    {
      "index": 2,
      "mapName": "Festival of life 2.h3m",
      "regionText": "This area is kept wild and is only culled every thirty years during the Festival of Life.  Each prospective is given a small section to clear and three allies to command in order to prove your capabilities as a leader.  In order to prove you are truly capable you must eliminate all creatures in this region, once this is completed you will have passed this test.",
      "prologText": "I have tamed a great beast.  Now I must tame the monsters of the land.  As the carnage grows, so does my power and bloodlust.  I will sit upon the throne of Krewlod.  Neither man or beast will stand in my way. ",
